        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8a923e936c544fa3b1e5e679ae8fd2fa",
      "statement": "The grounded-rate report evaluates candidate publish thresholds and decides nothing: pages with no text layer have no rate and are excluded from the denominator, the median is computed by the same function the publish gate uses, and a fully scanned document yields no distribution and no recommendation.",
