      "id": "claim_fdb09bd41a1c4811adc5f176de660a78",
      "statement": "VSIR_GROUNDED_RATE_THRESHOLD is read only by the distribution report, as the candidate being evaluated, and is deliberately not wired into the publish gate — the threshold reaches the gate by editing the pinned constant and shipping a release.",
