    {
      "id": "claim_d4684944c17b4f7aaf24dc3d2d4aee00",
      "statement": "The runner's Loop 5 vision escalation orders the pages it sends to read by the order skim_pages returned them, so a change to retrieval fusion reorders the read call and re-keys the ask replay fixtures that depend on it.",
